# Use with VS Code REST Client or equivalent HTTP tooling.
# Keep cookies enabled. Run session creation before learner requests.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create local demo session (cookie jar enabled)
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/session

### Your profile, pathway, progress and streak
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### Create a first pathway (409 if one already exists)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/me/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Ada","learner_type":"student","country":"Nigeria","goal":"Build data skills for an internship","hours":3,"device":"laptop","background":"Basic spreadsheets","low_data":true}

### Filter catalogue by market and keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/opportunities?country=Nigeria&q=data

### Review source/evidence-backed practice matching
GET {{baseUrl}}/opportunities/sample-data/assessment

### Mark the current first task complete
POST {{baseUrl}}/weeks/1/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"done","note":"Created a tracker and tested filtering."}

### Read history
GET {{baseUrl}}/check-ins

### Adjust future work; retain completed tasks
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/me/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{"hours":1,"device":"phone","low_data":true}

### Save interest (practice listings cannot be marked applied)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/applications/sample-data
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"interested"}

### Resource catalogue
GET {{baseUrl}}/resources

### Account deletion — run intentionally on your test session only
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/me
